  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating Progress to End FGM and Child Marriage in North Shewa (EOC-DICAC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project, building on the joint NCA and SC FGM and CEFM program from 2020 to 2024, will focus on North Shewa Zone in the Amhara region. Its core objective is to significantly reduce new cases of Female Genital Mutilation (FGM) and child marriage involving girls under 18 across all targeted intervention areas. By continuing efforts to protect vulnerable girls, the initiative aims to foster safer and more equitable communities.</narrative>
  </description>
